  "description": "Our Soar platform is a truly modern road bike with full carbon frame and fork. Engineered from Toray T700 carbon fiber for optimal power transfer and comfort whilst saving weight, the Soar is a rapid ride. Adding to the bikes top flight ride is front and rear through axles, internal headset, and internal cabling.The Soar 1.0 is built using Shimano Tiagra 20 speed gearing for reliable and precise shifting. The STI shifters offer great control whether on the hood or on the drops. Drivetrain comprises of a forged compact 50/34t crankset with sealed press fit bottom bracket matched to an 11-32t cassette. This provides great range as well as close matched ratios to keep that cadence consistent. Climbs or sprints this has you covered.Disc specific Formula 24 spoke wheels keep the rotational weight down to improve climbing, paired with Maxxis Pursuer 28c tyres give solid acceleration and confident road holding that urges you to push harder.Finished with a Selle Royal saddle and Reid bar tape the Soar 1.0 is a class act, it will take your road cycling to another level!",
